# v0.9 evidence & capability floors — demand the swarm cannot meet yet.
#
# `capability` matches only rows holding a PASSED behavioral contract
# (crystal v0.11: noise_shielding | pattern_completion); recorded-but-
# failed never satisfies. `min_evidence` floors the crystal evidence
# ladder (v0.10: absent field = 1 Observed; replicate=2, perturb=3...).
#
# As of 2026-08-07 the live registry holds no passed noise_shielding
# record, so this program resolves UNRESOLVED by design — its discovery
# request is the point: `--publish-discovery` turns the gap into swarm
# work, and the kannaka-apps research scheduler keeps a standing order
# for it. Supply path: evolve → promote --procedure replicate (L2) →
# promote --procedure behavior --capability noise_shielding.

cell ShieldedCore() {
    when always => base crystal.primitive "Standing Echo" capability "noise_shielding" min_evidence 2
}

grow ShieldedCore()
